<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Qulo — İtiraz / Appeal</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .card { max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 32px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; }
    .brand { color: #BB86FC; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #333; }
    p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; }
    .lang { font-size: 13px; color: #999; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    textarea { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 120px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; font: inherit; margin: 12px 0; }
    button { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #BB86FC; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="brand">Qulo</div>
    <h1>Hesap askıya alma itirazı</h1>
    <p>Bu kararın hatalı olduğunu düşünüyorsan aşağıya kısaca yaz ve gönder. Ekibimiz inceleyip e-posta ile dönüş yapar.</p>
    <p class="lang">If you think this suspension is a mistake, write a short note and submit. Our team will review it and reply by email.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/ban-appeal">
      <input type="hidden" name="token" value="<%= token %>">
      <textarea name="message" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" placeholder="İtiraz mesajın / Your message (optional)"></textarea>
      <button type="submit">İtiraz et · Appeal</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
